      "content": "but telling her is just making it worse. i'm watching her face change every day, watching her realize she's tied to a person who couldn't provide, who couldn't protect them. every day the descent gets more humiliating. it's like, the further i fall, the more i lose myself. i just want some kind of control back. i want to be able to look at my life and not see a disaster in progress. is there even a version of this where i don't just end up as a pathetic wreck?",
